        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.96240234375,
        510.2748718261719,
        97.58990478515625
      ],
      "text": "Given the risk of drug-induced hepatotoxicity, WHO recommends the fol- n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03689575195312,
        97.76239013671875,
        493.05938720703125,
        111.389892578125
      ],
      "text": "lowing dosages of anti-TB medicines for the treatment of TB in children:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73539733886719,
        117.56536865234375,
        513.4375,
        131.19287109375
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid (H)\t \t 10 mg/kg (range 10–15 mg/kg); maximum dose 300",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73539733886719,
        131.3653564453125,
        162.2733917236328,
        144.99285888671875
      ],
      "text": "mg/day",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73539733886719,
        145.16534423828125,
        513.4375,
        158.7928466796875
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin (R)\t 15 mg/kg (range 10–20 mg/kg); maximum dose 600",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73539733886719,
        158.96533203125,
        162.2733917236328,
        172.59283447265625
      ],
      "text": "mg/day",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73539733886719,
        172.76531982421875,
        360.6829528808594,
        186.392822265625
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide (Z)\t 35 mg/kg (30–40 mg/kg)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73539733886719,
        186.5653076171875,
        360.6829528808594,
        200.19281005859375
      ],
      "text": "ethambutol (E)\t 20 mg/kg (15–25 mg/kg)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.73539733886719,
        206.644287109375,
        398.2649230957031,
        219.99578857421875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        228.3677978515625,
        238.85191345214844,
        241.99530029296875
      ],
      "text": "Summary of recent evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        247.472900390625,
        513.4474487304688,
        260.832275390625
      ],
      "text": "showing that the serum levels  The Panel considered recent pharmacokinetic data 1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        263.46942138671875,
        513.4131469726562,
        276.8209228515625
      ],
      "text": "achieved in infants and young children under 2 years of age using the dosages listed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        279.4659423828125,
        513.447509765625,
        292.81744384765625
      ],
      "text": "above (2010) were higher than when using the previous (2006) dosages in the same",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        295.46246337890625,
        499.9465026855469,
        308.81396484375
      ],
      "text": "child. This is thus the most recent pharmacokinetic evidence to support the revisions.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        319.9689636230469,
        513.4589233398438,
        333.3204650878906
      ],
      "text": "The Panel then considered the ranges as recommended above, especially that for isoniazid,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        335.9654541015625,
        513.35546875,
        349.31695556640625
      ],
      "text": "where the lower end of the range is the same as the actual recommended dosage of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        351.9619445800781,
        513.4590454101562,
        365.3134460449219
      ],
      "text": "10 mg/kg. Because of implementation difficulties for the 2012 recommendation, the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        367.95843505859375,
        513.4014892578125,
        381.3099365234375
      ],
      "text": "Panel considered recent pharmacokinetic data on isoniazid in young children and recent",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        383.9549255371094,
        207.07591247558594,
        397.3064270019531
      ],
      "text": "analysis of existing data.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        408.46142578125,
        513.3670654296875,
        421.81292724609375
      ],
      "text": "It was recognized (and supported by evidence) that a dosage of 7 mg/kg and above for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        424.4579162597656,
        513.4013671875,
        437.8094177246094
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid will provide adequate serum levels in almost all children. Even children who are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        440.45440673828125,
        513.424560546875,
        453.805908203125
      ],
      "text": "younger than 2 years and/or are isoniazid fast acetylators (the two subgroups most likely",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        456.4508972167969,
        455.2459716796875,
        469.8023986816406
      ],
      "text": "to not reach optimal levels for drug action) will respond well to this dosage.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        480.9573974609375,
        513.4820556640625,
        494.30889892578125
      ],
      "text": "It was also recognized that around half of the same young children failed to reach",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        496.9538879394531,
        513.458984375,
        510.3053894042969
      ],
      "text": "adequate serum levels of isoniazid when receiving the previously (2006) recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        512.9503784179688,
        180.9134063720703,
        526.3018798828125
      ],
      "text": "dosage of 5 mg/kg.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        537.1808471679688,
        198.12892150878906,
        550.808349609375
      ],
      "text": "Other considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        556.2938842773438,
        513.3785400390625,
        569.6453857421875
      ],
      "text": "The Panel noted the difficulties of implementing the 2010 revised dosages using either",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        572.2903442382812,
        513.424560546875,
        585.641845703125
      ],
      "text": "currently available fixed-dose combinations (FDCs) or the FDC proposed for paediatric",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        588.286865234375,
        513.3784790039062,
        601.6383666992188
      ],
      "text": "use in the future. The critical difficulty is that the recommended dosage for isoniazid",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        604.2833862304688,
        513.4130249023438,
        617.6348876953125
      ],
      "text": "(10 mg/kg) is the same as the lower limit of the range (10-15 mg/kg) recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        620.2799072265625,
        513.4014892578125,
        633.6314086914062
      ],
      "text": "in 2010. Using FDCs of three essential drugs (rifampicin, isoniazid and pyrazinamide),",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        636.2764282226562,
        513.4246826171875,
        649.6279296875
      ],
      "text": "for many children it would be impossible to provide a dosage of isoniazid in the range",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        652.2728881835938,
        513.4013671875,
        665.6243896484375
      ],
      "text": "10-15 mg/kg without using a dosage of pyrazinamide that exceeded the recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        668.2694091796875,
        513.4821166992188,
        681.6209106445312
      ],
      "text": "range (thereby increasing the risk of hepatotoxicity) or without requiring additional",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        684.2659301757812,
        513.3671875,
        697.617431640625
      ],
      "text": "tablets of isoniazid alone (thereby imposing an additional pill burden and increasing the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        700.2623901367188,
        203.0393829345703,
        713.6138916015625
      ],
      "text": "risk of incorrect dosing).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        765.322021484375,
        512.464599609375,
        777.322021484375
      ],
      "text": "Thee S et al. Pharmacokinetics of isoniazid, rifampin, and pyrazinamide in children younger than two years of age with  1",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21649932861328,
        774.9219970703125,
        512.4645385742188,
        786.9219970703125
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis: evidence for implementation of revised World Health Organization recommendations.  Antimicrobial Agents",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21649169921875,
        784.52197265625,
        244.03245544433594,
        796.52197265625
      ],
      "text": ", 2011, 55:5560-5567. and Chemotherapy",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
